Subject: [PATCH 1/2] 4th grade: Garden Center stations 1 and 2

Measuring Cups (converting mass, volume, length, and time to smaller
units, mixed units, comparing across units, and time, money, metric, and
customary word problems) and Garden Beds (area or perimeter situations,
rectangle measurements with a rectangle picture, missing sides, and word
problems). New mix-ups: wrongFactor, joinedUnits, forgotSmallPart,
rawCompare, areaPerimeterSwap, halfPerimeter. Garden Center reward set.
Stations 3 (line plots) and 4 (angles) show as coming soon.

